# Build-context ignore for image builds that use the repo root as context
# (e.g. apps/workers/Dockerfile, which runs `turbo prune` over the workspace).
# Without this at the context root, Docker would transfer node_modules (~1.4GB)
# and other heavy dirs into the build, which is slow and can stall.

# Dependencies and build output (regenerated inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/generated/prisma

# VCS, editor, and agent tooling
.git
**/.git
.claude
.cursor
.ai

# Local env / secrets — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Compose + docs not needed by the worker image
docker-compose*.yml
docs
plans

# Logs
**/*.log
